<title>USA: Florida to sell $250 mln bond deal on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $250 mln bond deal on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida plans to sell $250 million Board of Education bonds Thursday at 1100 EDT, a market source said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bonds, which have been on the day-to-day calendar, will be sold by competitive bids.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
